{
  "$description": "Braun / Field design tokens — a precision instrument panel: anodized aluminium, POM keycaps, matte-black recesses, one International Orange and a signal-green LED. Raised parts are drawn as real keycaps: a lit top face, a solid skirt (the side wall) and a contact shadow. Shadow tokens reference the color tokens, so the dark theme only swaps colors. Build with `node scripts/build-tokens.mjs braun`.",
